CATCAS_SERIES_PARALLEL_RELATION 1
TYPE BOOLEAN_F3
NODE A EXTERNAL
NODE V EXTERNAL
NODE U INTERNAL
NODE W INTERNAL
NODE Z INTERNAL
RELATION R_AU A U 0 1 2 0
RELATION R_UW U W 0 1 0 0
RELATION R_WV W V 0 1 2 0
RELATION R_UZ U Z 0 0 1 0
RELATION R_ZV Z V 0 1 2 0
ELIMINATE W
ELIMINATE Z
ELIMINATE U
END
